1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,729
Welcome to Class 12 Physics, Unit 5: the Second Law of Thermodynamics.

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:08,867
The first law tells us energy is conserved.

3
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:12,044
The second law tells us which way things go.

4
00:00:12,044 --> 00:00:17,369
From it come the limits on every engine and every refrigerator ever built.

